Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.50
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.50: the mirrored download glyph is converted to luminance so the live progress ring renders black-and-white instead of Apple's red, the skip button is no longer clipped by its own circular mask, and the album page is measured for the full-bleed artwork work.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
